  "coverage": {
    "mode": "explicit-classified",
    "gaps": [
      "omega-php publishes no field on any of its templates, so a call argument is not a fact: the route path in Route::get('/users', ...), the view name in view('users.index'), the table name in Schema::create('users', ...) and the keys returned by config/*.php are string literals no Pack emits, and no join reaches them",
      "a Laravel facade is recognised here by the class name written at the '::', because omega-php publishes no 'qualifier' and so no PHP fact carries an external package to match 'Illuminate\\\\Support\\\\Facades\\\\Route' against",
      "@includeIf and @each name a view that omega-blade states, but 'directive' is a Pack attribute and attribute_equals compares against one constant, so only @extends and @include are stated",
      "route macros, container bindings made at runtime, middleware ordering and morph maps are runtime framework state and are not guessed"
    ]
  },
